# Live bot state — belongs on the `bot-state` branch, never on main.
# The paper-favorite workflow restores these at the start of a run and pushes
# them to bot-state at the end.
#
# These rules used to list executed_trades.csv / trade_history.csv /
# paper_trades*.csv, all of which were tracked anyway and force-added by the
# workflows (`git add -f`), so the ignore file was documenting a policy that
# nothing followed. Those files are now a FROZEN historical record of real
# money and stay tracked on main deliberately; only files a running bot
# rewrites are ignored here.
clv_sports.csv
CLV_SCOREBOARD.md
paper_trades_favorite.csv
# The live bot appends to this on every order, so it is state, not the frozen
# history it used to be. Tracking it on main AND restoring it from bot-state
# is what broke the persist step. Full history lives on bot-state and in
# main's git history.
executed_trades.csv
